{"seq":4,"slug":"observability-platforms","title":"可观测性平台","docCount":6,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sentry-platform","title":"Sentry 与错误监控平台","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/sentry-platform","wordCount":854,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"opentelemetry","title":"OpenTelemetry 前端集成","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/opentelemetry","wordCount":668,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"alerting-oncall","title":"告警体系与 On-Call 实践","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/alerting-oncall","wordCount":808,"readingTime":4},{"seq":4,"slug":"full-link-tracing","title":"全链路追踪","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/full-link-tracing","wordCount":943,"readingTime":4},{"seq":5,"slug":"sentry-integration","title":"Sentry 深度集成","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/sentry-integration","wordCount":827,"readingTime":4},{"seq":6,"slug":"custom-platform","title":"自建可观测平台","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-observability/observability-platforms/custom-platform","wordCount":949,"readingTime":4}],"introMarkdown":"# 可观测性平台 简介\n\n可观测性平台是将前端监控从零散的技术方案整合为统一工程基础设施的关键环节。一个成熟的可观测性平台能够将错误追踪、性能监控和用户行为分析整合到统一的数据平台上，提供从数据采集到洞察发现的端到端能力。\n\n本章介绍三种主流的平台实践方案。**Sentry 集成实践**讲解如何在前端项目中集成 Sentry 错误监控平台，包括 SDK 配置、Source Map 上传、性能追踪和告警规则设置等最佳实践。**自建监控平台**介绍从零构建企业级前端监控平台的技术架构，包括数据采集层、数据处理层、存储层和可视化层的技术选型和设计方案。**全链路追踪**探讨如何实现从前端用户操作到后端服务调用的全链路追踪，包括 Trace ID 传递、分布式追踪标准和前后端链路关联技术。\n\n建议读者先从 Sentry 集成了解成熟监控平台的功能边界和集成方法，再学习自建平台理解监控系统的技术架构，最后通过全链路追踪打通前后端的可观测性边界。\n"}